PENTRU VIZ

kit: The standard high-fidelity Omniverse/Isaac Sim GUI (this is the direct equivalent of what you are used to).

newton: A fast, low-overhead OpenGL visualizer for quick iteration (only shows physics debug markers, joints, etc.).

rerun: A web viewer with timeline scrubbing.

viser: A browser-based viewer via the Newton Warp renderer.